0..66 Comment "// A recursion over the values a universe decodes. The universe is"
67..145 Comment "// inductive-recursive, after Dybjer and Setzer: the list code\'s decode is the"
146..223 Comment "// lists over its element code\'s decode, and the function code\'s second field"
224..302 Comment "// names the decoder. A fixpoint stages one parameter, and over a universe the"
303..376 Comment "// staged parameter is the code: the code\'s case answers at the decode it"
377..454 Comment "// names, a function taking the value. An element\'s recursion descends on the"
455..529 Comment "// code, whose field the element code is; a list\'s tail stands at the list"
530..606 Comment "// code itself, so its descent is the list\'s and no descent of the code, and"
607..682 Comment "// the recursion on it is handed to a function staged on the lists. Written"
683..761 Comment "// directly, the tail call at the same code, and the stage a decode would need"
762..842 Comment "// to carry, are refused in `../../pathological/universe/decoded-descent.gandr`."
844..890 Comment "// The naturals, their addition and the lists."
